Ensigns has three licence regimes.

Code: MIT License. See LICENSE-MIT. It covers the libraries, generators,
tests, scripts, site code and deployment files.

Colour tokens and documentation: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International. See LICENSE-CC-BY-4.0. It covers the token files in
families/ and the prose in README files, changelogs and docs/.

Third-party files keep their own licences. Each one ships with its licence
text next to it.
